859:•urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:manifest:1.0#sha256-1k: SHA256 algorithm (see [RFC3174]) applied to first 1024 bytes of the compressed unencrypted file. 
901:•SHA1: The SHA1 algorithm (see [RFC3174]). 
1021:The manifest:version attribute identifies the version of OpenDocument specification that defines the schema and interpretation of the package manifest. The value of the manifest:version attribute shall be "1.4".
1025:The only value of the manifest:version attribute is 1.4.
1065:The <ds:Signature> element is defined by the [xmldsig-core] specification. Each <ds:Signature> element shall contain an Id attribute specifying a unique value. A producer may use the XAdES extensions as specified in ETSI TS 101 903 v1.4.1 [XAdES], or later versions of the XAdES specification.
1111:The dsig:version attribute identifies the version of OpenDocument specification that defines the schema and interpretation of the digital signature file. The value of the dsig:version attribute shall be "1.4".
1115:The only value of the dsig:version attribute is 1.4.
